<title>UK: Asda Props buys property for 6.2 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Asda Props buys property for 6.2 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asda Property Holdings Plc said on Friday that it has bought a freehold property from Land Securities Plc for 6.2 million stg.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the freehold property, situated in the Midlands, comprises a complete parade of 19 ground floor shop units, each with two floors of residential accommodation above and has rental income of 609,000 stg per annum.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
